        "note": "all 4 per-hole overrides land — Finding #7: the file previously used the bare-numeric hole:1..hole:4 form, which chargeCommand (mining.ts) resolves to the legacy 'hole_1'..'hole_4' id scheme, never matching the real H1..H4 ids drill_plan grid assigns; every charge silently failed (success:false, 'Hole \"hole_N\" not found', not thrown) and chargedCount stayed 0 through this entire file's history. Fixed by using the real hole ids."
